{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","瓦尔克"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名坚定的游侠，他会接下最强大敌人的悬赏令，将其击败。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我准备好了"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","能力随着年龄增长~"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Ability increases with age."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","先发制人！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","First strike."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我的赏金可没多少……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","The bounty on me.. .isn't even that big..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，有额外奖金吗？谢了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","What's this? A bonus? Alright."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","永远瞄准目标。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","开火，瞄准，顺序，那不重要。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","一，二，三，一，二，三，完美。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","我一般因为两件事出手，赏金够多，或者钱给得太迟。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","都说好搭档一定会记住对方的喜好，这话确实不假。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","有意思，你的心意我领了。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","难得有个安静的地方……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","今晚上哪儿打发时间呢"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来点够劲的，别客气！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这棵树是真的吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节我要大喝一杯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这怪兽真够大的！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我也去放两把焰火！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","瓦尔克不尊重规矩。规矩是人定的，他是人，自然能定自己的规矩。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","瓦尔克不储蓄。如果需要钱，去随手揭下几个悬赏令就好了。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","瓦尔克每到一个地方，都会先找酒馆喝上一杯，再考虑之后的事。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","瓦尔克入睡很快。过惯了风餐露宿的日子，保持精力是第一位的。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","当有人在餐馆招惹瓦尔克，他会先盯着对方，一口一口地把饭吃完再解决对方。像在吃仇人的血肉。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","为了朋友，瓦尔克赴汤蹈火、在所不辞。即便是过世的朋友。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","枪是赏金猎人的生命。瓦尔克有不止一把枪，但有一把枪，他虽然带在身上，却不常使用。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","瓦尔克用掉的弹夹摞起来能填满一整个屋子。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","瓦尔克全身的衣服都带着洗不掉的火药味。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","瓦尔克双手都能持枪。要是认为能找到瓦尔克攻击的死角，那可就大错特错了。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","对了对了，有件事我一直没问呢，之前偷走我项链的小偷到底是谁？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","萨忒娜 & 漫漫 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","你问战歌节胜者的名号？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","索恩 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","赏金猎人这行，有个笑话。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412050.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克 & 满满 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，瓦尔克老兄！我猜你们坐在这里太过无聊，所以过来凑个热闹，还有位置吧？"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412060.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","有人说，要把趁手的好枪当做恋人。"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412110.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克 & 漫漫 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","还有干粮吗？弹尽粮绝了。"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412130.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","萨忒娜，能不能帮我占卜……"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412140.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","等一下，你不能拿走我的水壶，那里面可是我从集市淘换来的好水，一点沙子都没掺。"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412150.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 满满 & 瓦尔克 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","喂，你们烤肉的速度太慢了！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412180.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","诡草 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","难得有个安静的地方……"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415056.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","来点够劲的，别客气！"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415057.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","这棵树是真的吗？"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415357.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节我要大喝一杯！"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415358.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","这怪兽真够大的！"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415525.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","我也去放两把焰火！"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415526.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克"]]}